{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Child stories created\n\n- S1 — tearing-unhealthy-quelea (`2a3d-9d00-927c-4d3c`): relocate the five docs evidence records to their tickets as verbatim comments, delete them plus the two moved stubs, and rewrite the phantom `docs/designs/sync-hardening-proposal.md` citations this epic owns. depends_on: decorative-taut-armedcrab (eval-harness epic's `docs/experiments` relocation; cross-epic, recorded at epic level as astounding-pictural-cowbird -> `e47b-d3ef-338f-4bcd`).\n- S2 — jestful-weighted-caiman (`c159-1621-c2a6-4385`): add the amended / context-landed banners to ADRs 0010, 0013, 0029, 0057, the 0083 status line, and the 0092 banner plus its `## Amendment (2026-09-04)` section. depends_on: none.\n- S3 — rubidium-magnific-billygoat (`8257-3a28-e757-4079`): write ADR 0119, the consolidated reconciler architecture record (20 final-form sections, provenance appendix), and mark the twenty originals Archived with bodies untouched. depends_on: jestful-weighted-caiman (S2), scabby-loverless-pipit (CLI epic, ADR 0117; cross-epic, recorded at epic level as astounding-pictural-cowbird -> `e045-84a5-e545-4f46`), masonic-excusable-guppy (MCP epic, ADR 0118; cross-epic, recorded at epic level as astounding-pictural-cowbird -> `04f1-5f92-3119-4731`).\n- S4 — radiated-obscene-pittabird (`6acd-24cc-8479-4db8`): move the operator procedures out of nine ADRs into `infra/runbooks/` (two new runbooks: `reconciler-live-matrix.md`, `plan-review-eval-ops.md`), leaving pointers behind. depends_on: rubidium-magnific-billygoat (S3).\n- S5 — snug-undesired-oryx (`28d0-148d-43a6-4e5e`): fix the doc drift the census found — the removed `edit_ticket(tags=…)` alias, the `[non-codebase]` spelling per ADR 0101, and the moved module paths in `docs/migrations.md`. depends_on: none.\n\nS3 additionally depends on the reconciler epic's package-move story (friended-brainsick-degus S1), linked by the session owner once that story's id is known.\n\nOrdering: S1 and S2 in parallel → S3 → S4; S5 anytime after S1 (no shared files)."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788808263222882499,"uuid":"1137d137-7d0e-46de-b3b5-75d89f17ec54"}